WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
Narrator: It always rings when your hands are full.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.500
[Phone ringing]

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
AI: Hi, Happy Paws Grooming. How can I help?

00:25.000 --> 00:28.500
Customer: Could I book Milo for his usual groom on Thursday?

00:28.500 --> 00:30.000
After lunch would be ideal.

00:31.500 --> 00:36.500
AI: There’s a two o’clock appointment available on Thursday.
Would you like that one?

00:42.500 --> 00:44.300
Customer: Two is perfect. Thank you.

00:45.500 --> 00:51.500
AI: You’re all set. Milo is booked for Thursday at two.
See you then.

00:54.000 --> 01:02.000
Narrator: The appointment’s booked. One less call to return.
And time for the plans you made.

01:03.000 --> 01:07.000
Be there for your customers. And for yourself.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.294
Meet your AI receptionist.
